{"version":1,"content":"<p>在日本提供網絡基礎設施及網絡金融服務等業務的GMO Internet Group Inc上周起遭網絡攻擊，周一（26日）晚遭黑客攻擊並勒索5000萬美元（約3.9億港元）加密貨幣，GMO表明拒絕支付贖金，黑客周二（27日）中午12時公開一名客戶的資料，並發動勒索軟件攻擊。</p><p>GMO表示暫不回應事件，但早前已呼籲客戶備份資料以及拔掉電腦電源。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T08:22:34.048452+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":170,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T07:53:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T13:38:14.238442+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T08:18:49.537772+00:00","content_hash":"a3d59ecece892be4a3ff2f9cf6279967af6848f6c26bf4d44d8d6961cecd1cb3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}